  "theorem": {
    "name": "rank_at_nodes_regular_bucket_dichotomy",
    "paper_d_v9_role": "regular overdetermined bucket decision before pivot charts",
    "required_distinct_nodes": "j+2",
    "statement": "For a t by (j+1) affine-linear matrix pencil M(Z), every maximal minor has degree at most j+1.  A full-rank specialization at one tested node gives a nonzero maximal minor; if all maximal minors vanish at j+2 distinct tested nodes, then all maximal minors vanish identically."
  }
